<translate>
==== ReplaceOnRotten ==== <!--T:1-->

<!--T:2-->
Indicates what item the original item will turn into after it rotten.
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
ReplaceOnRotten = IcecreamMelted,
</syntaxhighlight>
</translate>

